api_examples:
1) Minimal adapter usage:
- NewAdapter usage with typed callback and automatic retries:
  adapter := sdk.NewAdapter(func() sdk.Contract[SearchResult] { return &searchContract{} }, sdk.StreamingOptions{EnableResume:true, MaxRetryWindow:"30s"})
  err := adapter.Handle(ctx, stream, func(item SearchResult) error { fmt.Println(item.ID); return nil })

2) Explicit Decoder usage for advanced cases:
  dec := sdk.NewDecoder[SearchResult](contractFactory(), sdk.DecoderOptions{BufSize: 16*1024})
  for {
    item, err := dec.Next(ctx)
    if err == io.EOF { break }
    if err != nil { return err }
    // validate + process
  }
